{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"midiDevice"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MXLMidiDevice","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL13MXLMidiDeviceV","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLMidiDevice"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLScorePart\/Group2-swift.struct\/midiDevice"},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLScorePart","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLScorePart\/Group2-swift.struct"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"property","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Property","title":"midiDevice","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"midiDevice"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MXLMidiDevice","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL13MXLMidiDeviceV"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"externalID":"s:7IvorMXL12MXLScorePartV6Group2V10midiDeviceAA07MXLMidiG0VSgvp"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlscorepart\/group2-swift.struct\/mididevice"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The MIDI device assignment for this element."}],"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLScorePart":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The score-part type collects part-wide information for each part in a score. Often, each MusicXML part"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"corresponds to a track in a Standard MIDI Format 1 file. In this case, the midi-device element is used to make"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a MIDI device or port assignment for the given track or specific MIDI instruments. Initial midi-instrument"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"assignments may be made here as well. The score-instrument elements are used when there are multiple"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"instruments per track.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLScorePart"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLScorePart"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlscorepart","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLScorePart","title":"MXLScorePart"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLScorePart/Group2-swift.struct":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLScorePart\/Group2-swift.struct","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlscorepart\/group2-swift.struct","abstract":[{"text":"A single MIDI device and instrument assignment for a score-part.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","title":"MXLScorePart.Group2","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Group2"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Group2"}]},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter."}],"title":"IvorMXL","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLMidiDevice":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLMidiDevice"}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLMidiDevice"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlmididevice","role":"symbol","title":"MXLMidiDevice","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLMidiDevice","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The midi-device type corresponds to the DeviceName meta event in Standard MIDI Files. The optional port"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"attribute is a number from 1 to 16 that can be used with the unofficial MIDI 1.0 port (or cable) meta event.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Unlike the DeviceName meta event, there can be multiple midi-device elements per MusicXML part. The optional","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"id attribute refers to the score-instrument assigned to this device. If missing, the device assignment affects","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"all score-instrument elements in the score-part."}]},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLScorePart/Group2-swift.struct/midiDevice":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLScorePart\/Group2-swift.struct\/midiDevice","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlscorepart\/group2-swift.struct\/mididevice","role":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"midiDevice","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"midiDevice","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLMidiDevice","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL13MXLMidiDeviceV"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The MIDI device assignment for this element."}]}}}